;*****************************************************************************
;
; Module Name:  0E6A0122_MA112 USB to UART Data Bridge_v1.00.inf
;
; Function:
;	Install the Megawin MA112 USB to UART Data Bridge device on Win2000/XP/VISTA/7/8/10
;
; Version:
;	1.0.0.0
;
; Copyright (c) 1999-2016 Megawin Technology Co., Ltd.
